I did not write a permit for `approve_workorder`, so the agent cannot approve anything itself. The other mutating tools (`update_workorder`, `assign_technician`, `generate_work_order`, `cancel_workorder`) are also denied by default.

- **Source of approval:** I used the `get_workorder` approval fields because their allowed values are declared in the schema. The `authority_get_approval` output fields are free-form strings and the manifest doesn't say what values they take, so I did not match on them. The agent can still call that tool as a read-only lookup.
